WEBVTT

00:00:42.700 --> 00:00:45.960
This is our first face-to-face
meeting, isn't it?

00:00:45.960 --> 00:00:48.710
I'm Souma Kazuya, provisional king.

00:00:48.710 --> 00:00:53.840
It is my pleasure to meet you.
I am Georg Carmine.

00:00:53.840 --> 00:00:57.300
Congratulations on your recent victory.

00:00:57.300 --> 00:01:00.510
Lift up your head. It's too hard
to talk to you this way.

00:01:06.140 --> 00:01:08.560
<i>"...Keep on going anyway"</i>

00:01:08.560 --> 00:01:17.610
<i>Our bond strikes deep into my left breast</i>

00:01:21.620 --> 00:01:26.460
<i>We enjoy a fleeting happiness</i>
<i>after weathering one fog,</i>

00:01:26.460 --> 00:01:31.460
<i>until our vision becomes obscured again</i>

00:01:32.420 --> 00:01:37.430
<i>Bitterly betrayed, we grow</i>
<i>disgusted by our destiny</i>

00:01:37.430 --> 00:01:42.310
<i>But why does the dawn still come?</i>

00:01:42.310 --> 00:01:47.640
<i>We close our eyes and try to remember</i>

00:01:47.640 --> 00:01:52.980
<i>the chance of stopping, of never meeting</i>

00:01:52.980 --> 00:01:58.570
<i>From boundless zero to infinity,</i>

00:01:58.570 --> 00:02:04.080
<i>dreaming is the heartbeat of believing</i>

00:02:04.080 --> 00:02:07.910
<i>We'll move along alone and in pairs</i>

00:02:07.910 --> 00:02:14.050
<i>Don't stay put; our small,</i>
<i>though by no means helpless steps</i>

00:02:14.050 --> 00:02:18.840
<i>will open uncharted territory</i>
<i>for each of us</i>

00:02:18.840 --> 00:02:24.930
<i>Realize we will never again</i>
<i>let our dreams die on the vine</i>

00:02:24.930 --> 00:02:31.730
<i>The tear tracks that run down</i>
<i>our cheeks are shooting stars</i>

00:02:31.730 --> 00:02:35.570
<i>We're going to grab hold of them</i>

00:02:36.320 --> 00:02:39.610
"A Warrior Will Die for
One Who Understands Him"

00:02:43.320 --> 00:02:45.700
How is life in the dungeon?

00:02:45.700 --> 00:02:48.910
Surprisingly comfortable.

00:02:48.910 --> 00:02:50.830
It's peaceful in here.

00:02:50.830 --> 00:02:52.580
Peaceful, huh?

00:02:52.580 --> 00:02:55.050
That's pretty self-serving of you.

00:02:56.000 --> 00:02:58.300
Aren't you going to meet with Liscia?

00:02:58.300 --> 00:03:00.880
Has the princess anything to say to me?

00:03:00.880 --> 00:03:03.720
No, she's said nothing.

00:03:03.720 --> 00:03:10.230
Then I can only repeat what I said
when the princess asked to see me--

00:03:10.230 --> 00:03:12.520
What is the point of a lady who
is about to become the queen

00:03:12.520 --> 00:03:15.440
showing concern for a criminal?!

00:03:18.570 --> 00:03:23.030
I'm not convinced.
Knowing Liscia's personality,

00:03:23.030 --> 00:03:25.280
she took your words very seriously.

00:03:25.280 --> 00:03:28.040
She won't speak about you in front of me,

00:03:28.040 --> 00:03:32.250
and she's thrown herself into her work,
as though to distract herself.

00:03:33.540 --> 00:03:38.000
She's trying to act like it doesn't
bother her, but I know she's shaken up.

00:03:38.000 --> 00:03:43.390
I already said my farewells to the
princess following your ultimatum.

00:03:43.390 --> 00:03:46.010
No further words are necessary.

00:03:46.010 --> 00:03:51.230
So he's refusing for Liscia's sake.
Damn this stubborn old man.

00:03:51.230 --> 00:03:54.600
I have a question for you, as well.

00:03:54.600 --> 00:03:55.610
What is it?

00:03:55.610 --> 00:04:00.570
What has become of the soldiers
who followed us into rebellion?

00:04:00.570 --> 00:04:03.410
The soldiers have been cleared
of any charges after their exploits

00:04:03.410 --> 00:04:05.160
in the fighting against Amidonia.

00:04:06.490 --> 00:04:08.030
And the House of Vargas?

00:04:08.030 --> 00:04:13.290
Castor and Carla are the only two
who must answer for their crimes.

00:04:13.290 --> 00:04:15.580
The Vargas Duchy has been abolished,

00:04:15.580 --> 00:04:18.040
but the eldest son, Carl,
is carrying on the family name,

00:04:18.040 --> 00:04:21.260
and he has been allowed
to inherit Red Dragon City.

00:04:21.260 --> 00:04:25.340
What will be the fate of Castor and Carla?

00:04:25.340 --> 00:04:29.510
The two of them will be tried by me
personally at a later date.

00:04:29.510 --> 00:04:31.140
Then what about the nobility?

00:04:31.140 --> 00:04:32.600
After being stripped
of their family names,

00:04:32.600 --> 00:04:35.150
and having their lands and
possessions confiscated,

00:04:35.150 --> 00:04:38.650
they were executed.
The primary offenders publicly so,

00:04:38.650 --> 00:04:41.860
and those who were implicated
along with them, in private.

00:04:41.860 --> 00:04:43.950
I believe that was a wise decision.

00:04:43.950 --> 00:04:46.950
If they had made sure to cut
all ties first, as you did,

00:04:46.950 --> 00:04:50.740
then so many innocent relatives wouldn't
have been caught up with them.

00:04:52.000 --> 00:04:53.790
In accordance with the royal law,

00:04:53.790 --> 00:04:56.540
"Traitors and their kin up to the
third degree shall be executed."

00:04:56.540 --> 00:04:58.880
There is nothing more you could have done.

00:04:58.880 --> 00:05:00.550
Corruption, graft,

00:05:00.550 --> 00:05:04.050
collaboration with Amidonia,
misdeeds within their territories--

00:05:04.050 --> 00:05:07.340
best to stamp out the entire
corrupted family line.

00:05:07.340 --> 00:05:09.850
"Guilt by association"

00:05:07.340 --> 00:05:09.850
makes the others answerable

00:05:09.850 --> 00:05:12.140
for not having stopped them, right?

00:05:12.140 --> 00:05:14.640
But isn't three degrees a bit much?

00:05:14.640 --> 00:05:19.020
There isn't any other choice. Not only
are there humans and beastmen,

00:05:19.020 --> 00:05:21.150
but the longer-lived races, as well.

00:05:21.150 --> 00:05:25.530
As a result, the scope of their
association grows ever wider.

00:05:25.530 --> 00:05:29.200
Still, too many innocent
people have to die!

00:05:29.200 --> 00:05:34.750
I scrambled with Hakuya to get the law
revised just in time to two degrees.

00:05:34.750 --> 00:05:37.870
It was also all we could do to stay
the executions of those 13 and under,

00:05:37.870 --> 00:05:41.960
and have those children taken in
by orphanages or churches.

00:05:44.050 --> 00:05:47.680
That was very thoughtful of you.

00:05:47.680 --> 00:05:51.260
Your Majesty, does it pain you
to take the lives of others?

00:05:51.260 --> 00:05:53.390
There's no way it could be easy on me!

00:05:53.390 --> 00:05:56.180
With one order from me,
many lives are snuffed out!

00:05:56.180 --> 00:05:59.400
I feel like I could be crushed under
the weight of that responsibility.

00:05:59.400 --> 00:06:02.730
I was just an ordinary man
up until half a year ago!

00:06:02.730 --> 00:06:06.030
I have been told about you
in letters from the princess.

00:06:06.950 --> 00:06:12.780
She gives Your Majesty high praise
as being a king among kings,

00:06:12.780 --> 00:06:16.000
and says that she supports you,
body and soul.

00:06:16.000 --> 00:06:19.580
Liscia is supporting me very well.

00:06:19.580 --> 00:06:27.090
I'm going to have to make a decision
that causes Liscia grief, though. I...

00:06:28.170 --> 00:06:30.430
...have to kill you.

00:06:31.930 --> 00:06:34.720
Your plan was spectacular--

00:06:34.720 --> 00:06:36.980
get all the corrupt nobility
together in one place,

00:06:36.980 --> 00:06:40.770
and scoop up their hidden
funds in one smooth action.

00:06:40.770 --> 00:06:43.730
It was the best strategy for the kingdom.

00:06:43.730 --> 00:06:47.820
But it was a plan that
can't be made public.

00:06:47.820 --> 00:06:51.660
I never assumed that
it would be disclosed.

00:06:51.660 --> 00:06:54.240
It is certain that the families
of those fallen soldiers

00:06:54.240 --> 00:06:55.990
will not accept the situation
if they ever learn

00:06:55.990 --> 00:06:58.960
that I was working with
Your Majesty behind the scenes.

00:06:59.960 --> 00:07:01.750
And since it can't be made public,

00:07:01.750 --> 00:07:05.800
you must be treated the same
as those corrupt noblemen.

00:07:05.800 --> 00:07:09.630
I knew this from the outset.

00:07:09.630 --> 00:07:12.220
You really are an idiot!

00:07:12.220 --> 00:07:14.010
You knew all of this beforehand,

00:07:14.010 --> 00:07:16.680
and that you'd literally be taking
this secret to your grave!

00:07:16.680 --> 00:07:18.520
You stubborn fool!

00:07:22.560 --> 00:07:27.190
Tell me, is this really
the only way there was?

00:07:27.190 --> 00:07:30.900
Is this how you wanted it? Are you
content to have your name tarnished

00:07:30.900 --> 00:07:37.540
and to be locked into a suicide pact
with those corrupt nobles?!

00:07:37.540 --> 00:07:41.790
How can you look so composed?!

00:07:41.790 --> 00:07:44.000
There was a way where
we could take our time

00:07:44.000 --> 00:07:46.670
and purge those corrupt noblemen
on our own terms, right?!

00:07:46.670 --> 00:07:51.930
The same goes for Castor! He believed
that you had something in mind,

00:07:51.930 --> 00:07:57.100
and went along with his friendship for
you to the end, becoming a traitor!

00:07:57.100 --> 00:08:01.730
I had things I wanted you to do for me,
and you disrupted everything!

00:08:01.730 --> 00:08:05.730
Yeah, taking care of everything
at once is a huge deal.

00:08:05.730 --> 00:08:07.900
The kingdom has become more open now,

00:08:07.900 --> 00:08:10.400
and Hakuya's and my stock has risen!

00:08:10.400 --> 00:08:13.570
But what's the point
if it means losing you?!

00:08:13.570 --> 00:08:17.370
Do you know how hard a blow it
is to lose valuable personnel?!

00:08:17.370 --> 00:08:21.500
Answer me, Georg!
Are you really content with this?!

00:08:24.960 --> 00:08:26.380
Of course.

00:08:28.090 --> 00:08:32.630
If a new sprout starts growing
from the roots of a large tree

00:08:32.630 --> 00:08:37.930
which, like myself, was expected
to only grow old and wither,

00:08:37.930 --> 00:08:41.680
all one can do is pray that
that sprout grows well.

00:08:41.680 --> 00:08:46.350
Even if, as a result, that large tree
ends up falling to the ground?

00:08:46.350 --> 00:08:50.900
Your Majesty will someday come to know
the joy of feeling the strength

00:08:50.900 --> 00:08:53.950
of the next generation.

00:08:53.950 --> 00:08:59.080
Certainly once you start
having children with the princess.

00:09:05.370 --> 00:09:09.840
Did you think all of this up by yourself?

00:09:09.840 --> 00:09:12.090
What is that supposed to mean?

00:09:12.090 --> 00:09:17.510
You hold me in unusually high esteem.
It's not just this plan, either.

00:09:17.510 --> 00:09:21.180
You don't mean to leave me only Liscia,
whom you think of as a daughter;

00:09:21.180 --> 00:09:24.270
you're attempting to entrust
the future of the kingdom to me.

00:09:24.270 --> 00:09:29.520
That's strange any way you cut it, right?
Where does this allegiance stem from?

00:09:29.520 --> 00:09:34.280
If I learned of your extraordinary
talent from the princess's letters,

00:09:34.280 --> 00:09:36.070
would that leave you dissatisfied?

00:09:36.070 --> 00:09:41.200
Yeah, it would. You expect me to believe
that's where your loyalty comes from?

00:09:41.200 --> 00:09:46.960
If you're going to martyr yourself, it
would be for the Elfrieden royal family.

00:09:46.960 --> 00:09:52.170
Was this plan of yours carried
out under <i>their </i>orders?

00:09:52.170 --> 00:09:53.550
I will remain silent.

00:09:53.550 --> 00:10:00.050
Answer me. What do they--
and <i>you</i>--know, exactly?

00:10:02.260 --> 00:10:04.930
You won't answer me,
no matter what, will you?

00:10:04.930 --> 00:10:10.020
When the time comes,
they will tell you themselves.

00:10:24.490 --> 00:10:25.910
Poisoned wine.

00:10:25.910 --> 00:10:30.040
I can't bear to let a man who is
sacrificing himself for his country,

00:10:30.040 --> 00:10:32.750
whatever form that may take,
be publicly executed.

00:10:32.750 --> 00:10:34.630
I offer my gratitude.

00:10:34.630 --> 00:10:38.840
I'll recommend the same for those
who would sacrifice themselves for you.

00:10:40.180 --> 00:10:42.180
Sacrifice themselves for me?

00:10:42.180 --> 00:10:44.930
There are a number of
senior staff in the army,

00:10:44.930 --> 00:10:47.480
including your second-in-command, Beowulf,

00:10:47.480 --> 00:10:52.310
who are requesting the same sentence
as the one you're receiving.

00:10:52.310 --> 00:10:54.320
I'm tired of people being so eager to die.

00:11:02.700 --> 00:11:08.000
Your Majesty, please take the
utmost care of the princess for me.

00:11:08.000 --> 00:11:12.830
Liscia is already an indispensable
member of my family.

00:11:12.830 --> 00:11:15.630
No matter what comes my way,
I keep my family safe.

00:11:15.630 --> 00:11:18.920
That is one conviction
I will never change.

00:11:18.920 --> 00:11:22.220
I am relieved to hear that.

00:11:22.220 --> 00:11:24.680
I will be praying for the glory
of the Kingdom of Elfrieden

00:11:24.680 --> 00:11:29.770
and for Your Majesty and the princess's
happiness from beyond the grave.

00:11:30.940 --> 00:11:33.770
And now, I beg your leave.

00:12:04.180 --> 00:12:06.430
Georg is dead.

00:12:09.060 --> 00:12:10.390
I see...

00:12:22.860 --> 00:12:25.700
Thank you very much, Jeanne.

00:12:25.700 --> 00:12:29.120
You even sent it via gryphon cavalry, too.

00:12:29.120 --> 00:12:33.790
Using this, the kingdom and the empire
can contact each other at any time.

00:12:33.790 --> 00:12:35.670
Of course I put a rush on it.

00:12:36.880 --> 00:12:41.590
My sister gladly agreed
to all of your proposals.

00:12:41.590 --> 00:12:44.550
I've never seen her like this before.

00:12:44.550 --> 00:12:46.510
She must have been pretty pleased.

00:12:46.510 --> 00:12:49.640
Pleased, you say?

00:12:49.640 --> 00:12:53.230
To be able to share her values
with someone--or dare I say,

00:12:53.230 --> 00:12:55.600
gaining someone who understands her.

00:12:55.600 --> 00:12:57.060
I see.

00:12:57.060 --> 00:12:58.400
With all that's happening,

00:12:58.400 --> 00:13:00.190
I'd like to arrange a virtual conference

00:13:00.190 --> 00:13:03.030
between King Souma and
my sister as soon as possible.

00:13:03.030 --> 00:13:05.160
Yes, by all means.

00:13:05.160 --> 00:13:10.410
Incidentally, Hakuya, I see
a lot of books behind you.

00:13:10.410 --> 00:13:15.870
Oh, those are the books we're
borrowing from Van as collateral.

00:13:15.870 --> 00:13:19.710
There are many things I'd like to copy
out before we have to return them.

00:13:19.710 --> 00:13:23.720
I was just in the middle of sorting them.

00:13:23.720 --> 00:13:27.050
Hakuya, you organize them yourself?

00:13:27.050 --> 00:13:29.300
You must really like books.

00:13:29.300 --> 00:13:33.770
Oh, pardon me. I have a real
soft spot for reading material.

00:13:33.770 --> 00:13:37.190
Then if I arrange the post of chief
librarian at the imperial library,

00:13:37.190 --> 00:13:39.730
would you come to our country?

00:13:39.730 --> 00:13:42.440
Oh, that does sound appealing.

00:13:42.440 --> 00:13:46.110
Before, I would have leapt at
the chance without hesitation.

00:13:46.110 --> 00:13:47.740
So that's a "no," then.

00:13:47.740 --> 00:13:51.950
Right now, I'd like to keep moving
His Majesty's new era forward.

00:13:51.950 --> 00:13:55.540
And, once one of his heirs takes
the throne, I'd like to retire,

00:13:55.540 --> 00:13:59.080
and become a historian
chronicling this age.

00:13:59.080 --> 00:14:04.130
A comfortable retirement. That may
be a luxury, given our times.

00:14:04.130 --> 00:14:08.340
You're right about that. Stepping down
and having a comfortable retirement

00:14:08.340 --> 00:14:10.760
may be too much to expect from this age.

00:14:12.510 --> 00:14:14.770
Oh, would you look at the time.

00:14:14.770 --> 00:14:19.100
I seem to lose track of time
when talking to you, Hakuya.

00:14:19.100 --> 00:14:22.900
As do I. Thanks for an enjoyable time.

00:14:33.790 --> 00:14:35.120
Prime Minister Hakuya...

00:14:35.120 --> 00:14:36.290
How is it coming?

00:14:36.290 --> 00:14:39.420
Everything is going well. However...

00:14:39.420 --> 00:14:44.250
It just feels as though things are
moving along a little too smoothly.

00:14:44.250 --> 00:14:51.140
Almost as though there is some other,
separate will at work here.

00:14:51.140 --> 00:14:53.390
Someone else's will?

00:14:58.810 --> 00:15:01.600
Nothing in this one, either.

00:15:04.900 --> 00:15:07.190
Maybe that really was the only book

00:15:07.190 --> 00:15:10.360
mentioning the Amidonian
Royal Family tree.

00:15:16.790 --> 00:15:18.830
A bronze raccoon?

00:15:18.830 --> 00:15:24.090
Indeed, there is no shortage
of talent among Amidonia.

00:15:28.340 --> 00:15:33.550
As I said earlier, you cannot
go out, Princess Roroa.

00:15:33.550 --> 00:15:36.390
What, do you have eyes
in the back of your head?

00:15:36.390 --> 00:15:39.930
You know, I'm starting to get tired
of being cooped up like this.

00:15:40.940 --> 00:15:43.480
Princess Roroa, weren't you the one to say

00:15:43.480 --> 00:15:46.730
that we'd best not move until
the situation in Van settles down?

00:15:46.730 --> 00:15:51.240
Yeah, I know. But I am <i>so bored</i>!

00:15:51.240 --> 00:15:55.200
In that case, please start thinking
about Amidonia's future.

00:15:55.200 --> 00:15:57.540
Amidonia's future?

00:15:57.540 --> 00:16:01.000
That includes my future husband, huh?

00:16:05.000 --> 00:16:09.710
I feel sorry for the man who becomes
Princess Roroa's future husband.

00:16:11.090 --> 00:16:13.930
Glaive Magna!

00:16:13.930 --> 00:16:17.140
Your loyalty has been truly outstanding.

00:16:17.140 --> 00:16:18.970
As reward for your loyalty,

00:16:18.970 --> 00:16:22.810
you are granted Randel and
the territory surrounding it.

00:16:22.810 --> 00:16:25.690
Yes, sir. I thank you with great joy.

00:16:25.690 --> 00:16:28.980
Further, you are provisionally
granted a portion of the authority

00:16:28.980 --> 00:16:32.740
held by Army General Georg Carmine.

00:16:32.740 --> 00:16:36.950
Maintain the army until it is reorganized
into the kingdom's defense force.

00:16:36.950 --> 00:16:42.710
Yes, sir. I shall endeavor to live up
to His Majesty's expectations.

00:16:42.710 --> 00:16:45.630
Aisha Udgard!

00:16:50.960 --> 00:16:55.220
Aisha Udgard, you are formally...

00:16:56.340 --> 00:17:01.270
You are formally granted the rank
of King's Personal Guardian.

00:17:01.270 --> 00:17:03.020
Yes, sire.

00:17:03.020 --> 00:17:07.310
Wodan Udgard, of the God-Protected Forest!

00:17:09.570 --> 00:17:12.400
Even as you were dealing
with your disaster recovery,

00:17:12.400 --> 00:17:14.740
you were good enough
to dispatch reinforcements.

00:17:14.740 --> 00:17:20.290
Not at all. We dark elves wished only
to repay the kindness you showed us.

00:17:20.290 --> 00:17:23.750
I would like to show my appreciation
for your reinforcements.

00:17:23.750 --> 00:17:26.710
If there is anything you desire,
just name it.

00:17:28.170 --> 00:17:31.380
In that case, I do have one
request of Your Majesty.

00:17:32.880 --> 00:17:36.430
Would you please accept
my daughter's hand?

00:17:36.430 --> 00:17:38.050
Huh?

00:17:38.050 --> 00:17:40.060
Father!

00:17:40.060 --> 00:17:41.140
What the...?

00:17:41.140 --> 00:17:44.060
Please, would you take her
to be your wife?

00:17:44.060 --> 00:17:49.900
Uh, it is possible to welcome
in Aisha as your second queen.

00:17:49.900 --> 00:17:54.690
Th-That would be something
you consider a reward?

00:17:56.030 --> 00:17:58.700
As her father, my feelings
are complicated,

00:17:58.700 --> 00:18:01.280
but it does appear to be her wish.

00:18:08.750 --> 00:18:10.750
Aisha <i>is </i>cute.

00:18:10.750 --> 00:18:15.760
If it's a question of wanting to
marry her or not, I would, but...

00:18:23.470 --> 00:18:26.560
Souma, go ahead and take Aisha to wife.

00:18:26.560 --> 00:18:29.810
Huh? L-Liscia, you're all right with this?

00:18:29.810 --> 00:18:31.770
Souma, you're the king.

00:18:31.770 --> 00:18:34.940
There may be times going forward
where you will have to marry

00:18:34.940 --> 00:18:38.240
the daughters of aristocrats
or foreign princesses.

00:18:38.240 --> 00:18:39.490
So when that happens,

00:18:39.490 --> 00:18:43.830
I want to be sure the top-ranked queens
are already those that I know well.

00:18:44.830 --> 00:18:46.830
Yeah, but still...

00:18:46.830 --> 00:18:49.920
Souma, you can make tough decisions
when the kingdom is on the line,

00:18:49.920 --> 00:18:53.590
but you're so indecisive when it
comes to relations with women.

00:18:53.590 --> 00:18:55.920
For crying out loud...

00:18:55.920 --> 00:18:56.880
Aisha!

00:18:56.880 --> 00:18:58.380
Y-Yes?

00:18:58.380 --> 00:19:01.510
I have no intention of giving up
the throne as first queen.

00:19:01.510 --> 00:19:03.640
Can you live with being second queen?

00:19:03.640 --> 00:19:07.640
If so, I have no objection.
In fact, I welcome you.

00:19:07.640 --> 00:19:11.770
Y-Yes, as long as it means
being at His Majesty's side!

00:19:16.780 --> 00:19:21.780
Aisha, um... would you be my wife?

00:19:23.370 --> 00:19:25.620
Yes! Gladly!

00:19:34.880 --> 00:19:37.300
Juna Doma!

00:19:37.300 --> 00:19:38.760
Juna Doma, you are--

00:19:38.760 --> 00:19:40.510
Your Majesty, let my achievements--

00:19:40.510 --> 00:19:42.930
May I have a moment, please?

00:19:48.100 --> 00:19:53.520
Please forgive my sudden outburst.
I ask for permission to speak.

00:19:53.520 --> 00:19:54.980
Permission granted.

00:19:54.980 --> 00:20:00.530
Thank you very much.
Juna Doma is my granddaughter.

00:20:00.530 --> 00:20:04.990
However, Juna's father is the
son-in-law of the Doma family,

00:20:04.990 --> 00:20:09.370
a merchant family in Lagoon City. As such,

00:20:09.370 --> 00:20:12.210
Juna is of commoner lineage.

00:20:13.330 --> 00:20:15.250
What are you getting at?

00:20:15.250 --> 00:20:18.050
You are planning to use your achievements

00:20:18.050 --> 00:20:21.300
to mitigate measures against me--no,
against Castor and his daughter.

00:20:21.300 --> 00:20:23.300
But Grandmother...

00:20:25.260 --> 00:20:28.640
You are someone who has no
involvement with the House of Vargas.

00:20:28.640 --> 00:20:32.560
You must use your achievements
for your own ends.

00:20:32.560 --> 00:20:35.020
Pleading for the life of Castor
and his daughter is of no avail.

00:20:35.020 --> 00:20:36.480
Grandmother...

00:20:39.070 --> 00:20:41.700
Your Majesty, if I may ask...

00:20:41.700 --> 00:20:43.450
What is it?

00:20:43.450 --> 00:20:48.700
If possible, I wish to join
the princess and Aisha,

00:20:48.700 --> 00:20:51.540
and sing henceforth
at Your Majesty's side.

00:20:51.540 --> 00:20:53.120
Huh?

00:20:53.120 --> 00:20:57.460
That means making Juna
my wife, too, doesn't it?

00:20:57.460 --> 00:21:00.420
Your Majesty, Juna Doma
could be your consort--

00:21:00.420 --> 00:21:04.300
No, I'm sorry, but I can't allow that.

00:21:04.300 --> 00:21:06.090
It isn't currently possible.

00:21:11.180 --> 00:21:14.230
You are the Gemstone
program's Prima Lorelei.

00:21:14.230 --> 00:21:16.400
Your popularity among the people is great.

00:21:16.400 --> 00:21:19.440
But what would happen if it were
announced that you were engaged?

00:21:19.440 --> 00:21:21.530
Violence would break out in the capital.

00:21:23.610 --> 00:21:26.410
Could you wait for a little while longer?

00:21:26.410 --> 00:21:30.910
The program still needs
its Prima Lorelei Juna.

00:21:30.910 --> 00:21:36.960
So for right now, please keep on being
the people's songstress a bit longer.

00:21:36.960 --> 00:21:39.540
The people's songstress?

00:21:39.540 --> 00:21:41.710
Once we have assembled more singers,

00:21:41.710 --> 00:21:45.590
and have others who can
carry on the tradition,

00:21:45.590 --> 00:21:48.300
I promise I will come for you then.

00:21:52.020 --> 00:21:55.690
I will be waiting eagerly
for that day, Your Majesty.

00:22:07.070 --> 00:22:11.120
<i>"What are we supposed to choose?"</i>

00:22:11.120 --> 00:22:16.370
<i>Our voices imploring the future are hoarse</i>

00:22:16.370 --> 00:22:22.500
<i>We've become so afraid</i>
<i>of what we could lose</i>

00:22:22.500 --> 00:22:27.430
<i>that we're just frozen in place</i>

00:22:27.430 --> 00:22:31.890
<i>How many times have we made mistakes</i>

00:22:31.890 --> 00:22:37.850
<i>because we wanted to check our "answers"?</i>

00:22:37.850 --> 00:22:45.190
<i>Before we knew it we were in love,</i>
<i>we had fallen in love</i>

00:22:45.190 --> 00:22:49.410
<i>I'll hold fast to you</i>
<i>in the times we're in</i>

00:22:49.410 --> 00:22:55.250
<i>We who set alight</i>
<i>our finite lives to fight</i>

00:22:55.250 --> 00:23:00.500
<i>are noble and beautiful above all</i>

00:23:00.500 --> 00:23:04.500
<i>As long as we create</i>
<i>as many bright tomorrows</i>

00:23:04.500 --> 00:23:09.800
<i>as the indelible wounds we suffer,</i>

00:23:09.800 --> 00:23:18.850
<i>we can be proud of all</i>
<i>we've woven together</i>

00:23:31.780 --> 00:23:34.700
The king has built up momentum.

00:23:34.700 --> 00:23:37.250
We have no choice
but to do as the king directs,

00:23:37.250 --> 00:23:39.960
lest we be caught up by that momentum.

00:23:39.960 --> 00:23:43.540
We move in the shadows,
even as we obey the king's orders.

00:23:43.540 --> 00:23:47.880
Yes. We will keep a low profile,
so as not to get caught,

00:23:47.880 --> 00:23:50.550
as we control this country
from behind the scenes.
